---
import SiteLayout from "../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout title="链接">
  <section class="page-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">AROUND THE CORNER</p>
    <h1>链接与友链</h1>
    <p>常用入口与值得收藏的内容。</p>
  </section>
  <div class="link-grid">
    <a class="companion-card" href="/ff14/">
      <span class="eyebrow">EORZEA</span>
      <h2>FF14 专区 ↗</h2>
      <p>资源站整理、通关记录和固定队复盘工具。</p>
    </a>
    <a class="companion-card" href="/anime-calendar/">
      <span class="eyebrow">WATCHLIST</span>
      <h2>追番日历 ↗</h2>
      <p>正在追的番剧和剧集。</p>
    </a>
    <a class="companion-card" href="/atom.xml">
      <span class="eyebrow">KEEP IN TOUCH</span>
      <h2>RSS 订阅 ↗</h2>
      <p>将最新文章带到你喜欢的阅读器。</p>
    </a>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
